                                            * BPS                  09/09/06  v1.4 - Starting 1.4                            D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\app.X\source\UBW.c
                                            * - Fixed Microchip bug with early silicon - UCONbits.PKTDIS = 0;               D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\app.X\source\UBW.c
